  "data": {
    "ruleType": "army-rule",
    "summary": "When a battle round starts, you may select one imperative. Through round end, each of your units with Doctrina Imperatives gains the selected effects. PROTECTOR IMPERATIVE grants [HEAVY] to its ranged weapons and improves their Ballistic Skill by 1. Apply −1 to incoming melee Hit rolls if the unit is within 6″ of a friendly ADEPTUS MECHANICUS BATTLELINE unit. CONQUEROR IMPERATIVE grants [ASSAULT] to its ranged weapons and improves its melee weapons’ Weapon Skill by 1. Under the same 6″ condition, improve the Armour Penetration of attacks made by models in the unit by 1.",
